{"at": "2026-09-18T07:22:17.957261+00:00", "pr": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/595", "id": 4565964253, "node_id": "PR_kwDOUJyJf88AAAABECcV3Q", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/595", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/595.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/595.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/595", "number": 595, "state": "open", "locked": false, "title": "feat(local): route approved merge trains through the daemon", "user": {"login": "Dengnifer", "id": 89234078, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer", "html_url": "https://github.com/Dengnifer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "### Motivation\n- Address #593. The reviewed merge-train tool needs a daemon caller so independently approved stale PRs can be integrated while model lanes remain disabled.\n\n### Description\n- Match a requested batch's pinned heads against the approved-candidate scan and preserve the PR-to-SHA mapping into the train. Compare pins under member claims and retain checks for accepted and dropped members in the publication verifier.\n- Prepare the primary checkout without discarding local history. Require every unpublished commit's paths and modes to satisfy the existing passive-telemetry policy before synchronization.\n- Invoke the existing train synchronously, preserving its combined CI, claims, leases and post-push checks. Keep the individual-PR path and number-only standalone train callers, and provide a concrete deployment patch and activation instructions.\n- Runtime activation and the first live batch remain downstream of independent review and merge.\n\n### Testing\n- Published head `c55a406975d6b17ec4a92f993fc6d76105439d42`: all nine local CI statuses passed in 383 seconds. All eight gates ran, including build, blueprint rendering, synchronization and statement-origin.\n- The CI suite and normal commit hook each passed 741 tests with 9 skipped. Nine focused adapter tests, eight selected train scenarios and the dropped-pin verifier regression also passed, covering the two reported failure paths and unchanged callers/conflict drops.\n- The rooted axiom audit passed 1,659 declarations with zero failures and three existing statement-level warnings. No proof-level leanok declaration depends on sorryAx.\n- The worktree is clean and fifteen repair-handoff artifact hashes were verified. The deployment patch and active runtime hashes remain unchanged; no daemon activation or live train has run.\n- A fresh bounded F1/F2/integration recheck of review 5244965776 remains required.\n\n---\nAddresses #593\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T06:10:44Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T07:22:16Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025011061, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8bdQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/infrastructure", "name": "infrastructure", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Foundational definitions, shared APIs, o